        "PMC11642357::web::020::4_discussion",
        "PMC11642357::web::021::5_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt-spinning can impose cooling rates of approximately 10^5–10^6 K/s on this alloy.",
