        "PMC11642357::web::005::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Changing from cooling at about 52 K/s to melt-spinning at 10^5–10^6 K/s improves the glass-forming ability of Cr16Mn16Fe16Co16Ni16P20.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
